#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""lyrics-carousel - vertical carousel of the lyrics that are playing.

Reads the active MPRIS player with playerctl, looks up the lyrics (LRCLIB and,
when available, the source adapter of the Noctalia Lyrics plugin) and draws
them in the terminal with continuous vertical scrolling.

The pixel font is applied when kitty is launched from Floating Term; the
script does not need to know anything about the font.
"""

